## ProductGroupPromotionsApi

### Create product group promotions
## Create product group promotions
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/product_group_promotions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ad_group_id": "<string>",
 "product_group_promotion": "<string>"
}


### Get a product group promotion by id
## Get a product group promotion by id
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/product_group_promotions/{{product_group_promotion_id}}
Accept: application/json

### Get product group promotions
## Get product group promotions
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/product_group_promotions?bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}&order={{order}}&productGroupPromotionIds={{productGroupPromotionIds}}&entityStatuses={{entityStatuses}}&adGroupId={{adGroupId}}
Accept: application/json

### Update product group promotions
## Update product group promotions
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/product_group_promotions
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "ad_group_id": "<string>",
 "product_group_promotion": "<string>"
}


### Get product group analytics
## Get product group analytics
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/ad_accounts/{{ad_account_id}}/product_groups/analytics?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}&productGroupIds={{productGroupIds}}&columns={{columns}}&granularity={{granularity}}&clickWindowDays={{clickWindowDays}}&engagementWindowDays={{engagementWindowDays}}&viewWindowDays={{viewWindowDays}}&conversionReportTime={{conversionReportTime}}&reportingTimezone={{reportingTimezone}}
Accept: application/json
